{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_xqtKnEoCZHIVFCIMdSNama2I","content":"146\t(defn export-program\n147\t  \"The program whose value is the donor's `export`, read from its runtime's\n148\t   global namespace after its body ran.\"\n149\t  [donor export]\n150\t  (let [{:keys [read-export]} (profile (:frontend donor))]\n151\t    (u/mark-tails\n152\t      (u/seq-nodes (concat (runtime-entry [(:frontend donor)])\n153\t                           (donor-run donor)\n154\t                           [(u/sexp->uast (read-export export))])))))\n155\t\n156\t\n157\t(defn compose\n158\t  \"The caller program: the donor's body run, each name of `exports` read\n159\t   from the donor runtime and projected into `caller-frontend`'s namespace\n160\t   under the same name, then `caller-source`, lowered unmodified, run under\n161\t   its runtime's entry. Its value is the caller entry's value.\"\n162\t  [donor exports caller-frontend caller-source]\n163\t  (let [{:keys [read-export]} (profile (:frontend donor))\n164\t        {:keys [project parse unit run-main]} (profile caller-frontend)]\n165\t    (u/mark-tails\n166\t      (u/seq-nodes\n167\t        (concat (runtime-entry [(:frontend donor) caller-frontend])\n168\t                (donor-run donor)\n169\t                (map (fn [export] (u/sexp->uast (project export (read-export export))))\n170\t                     exports)\n171\t                [(u/app (u/v run-main) (unit (parse caller-source)))])))))\n172\t\n173\t\n174\t(defn link-source\n175\t  \"The serving composition naming the runtimes and the donor module.\"\n176\t  [{:keys [module address]}]\n177\t  (h/source {'yang.call (:call-address @h/published),\n178\t             'js (:address @h/published),\n179\t             'php (:address @published-php),\n180\t             module address}))\n181\t\n182\t\n183\t(defn- modules\n184\t  \"The host registry, admitted by every runtime profile that checks it.\"\n185\t  []\n186\t  (php-prelude/admit (h/registry)))\n187\t\n188\t\n189\t(defn run-program\n190\t  \"`{backend value}` of `ast`, linked against `donor`, on each vector VM.\"\n191\t  [donor ast]\n192\t  (let [src (link-source donor)]\n193\t    (into (sorted-map)\n194\t          (map (fn [backend]\n195\t                 [backend\n196\t                  (try\n197\t                    (vm/value (h/run-linked backend ast {:modules (modules),\n198\t                                                         :link-source src}))\n199\t                    (catch clojure.lang.ExceptionInfo e\n200\t                      (throw (ex-info (.getMessage e)\n201\t                                      (select-keys (ex-data e)\n202\t                                                   [:yin.vm.data/op :yin.vm.data/reason\n203\t                                                    :yin.vm.data/expected])))))]))\n204\t          (keys h/backends))))\n205\t\n206\t\n207\t(defn agreed\n208\t  \"The one value every backend of `results` answered, else\n209\t   `{:disagreement results}`.\"\n210\t  [results]\n211\t  (let [vs (set (vals results))]\n212\t    (if (= 1 (count vs)) (first vs) {:disagreement results})))\n213\t\n214\t\n215\t(defn call\n216\t  \"Publish the donor `[frontend source]`, compose its `exports` into the\n217\t   caller `[frontend source]`, run it on each vector VM and answer the\n218\t   caller's rendered value when every backend agrees (else\n219\t   `{:disagreement {backend rendered}}`).\"\n220\t  [[donor-frontend donor-source] exports [caller-frontend caller-source]]\n221\t  (let [donor (publish-donor! donor-frontend donor-source)\n222\t        render (:render (profile caller-frontend))]\n223\t    (agreed (update-vals (run-program donor (compose donor exports caller-frontend\n224\t                                                     caller-source))\n225\t                         render))))"}
